sociation IS Bindra Stadium, Mohali': 'Punjab Cricket Association Stadium, Mohali',\n","          'IS Bindra Stadium': 'Punjab Cricket Association Stadium, Mohali',\n","          'Rajiv Gandhi Intl. Cricket Stadium': 'Rajiv Gandhi International Stadium, Uppal',\n","          'Dr. Y.S. Rajasekhara Reddy ACA-VDCA Cricket Stadium': 'ACA-VDCA Stadium'}\n","\n","for col in ['team1', 'team2', 'toss_winner', 'winner']:\n","    m[col] = m[col].replace(teams)\n","for col in ['batting_team', 'bowling_team']:\n","    d[col] = d[col].replace(teams)\n","m['venue'] = m['venue'].replace(venues)\n","m['city'] = m['city'].replace({'Bengaluru': 'Bangalore'})\n","\n","m['winner'] = m['winner'].fillna('No Result')\n","m['player_of_match'] = m['player_of_match'].fillna('No Award')\n","m.loc[m['venue'] == 'Dubai International Cricket Stadium', 'city'] = 'Dubai'\n","m[['umpire1', 'umpire2']] = m[['umpire1', 'umpire2']].fillna('Unknown')\n","m = m.drop(columns='umpire3', errors='ignore')   \n","\n","m['date'] = pd.to_datetime(m['date'], format='%Y-%m-%d', errors='coerce').fillna(\n","            pd.to_datetime(m['date'], format='%d/%m/%y', errors='coerce'))\n","\n","# some super over balls are not flagged\n","d.loc[d['inning'] > 2, 'is_super_over'] = 1\n","\n","legal = (d['wide_runs'] == 0) & (d['noball_runs'] == 0)\n","balls = legal.groupby([d['match_id'], d['inning'], d['over']]).transform('sum')\n","d = d[~(d.duplicated() & (balls > 6))].reset_index(drop=True)\n","m = m.drop_duplicates('id')\n","\n","played = m[m['winner'] != 'No Result']\n","print('missing:', m.isnull().sum().sum())\n","print('bad dates:', (m['date'].dt.year != m['season']).sum())\n","print('runs mismatch:', (d['batsman_runs'] + d['extra_runs'] != d['total_runs']).sum())\n","print('unknown match ids:', len(set(d['match_id']) - set(m['id'])))\n","print('wrong winner:', ((played['winner'] != played['team1']) & (played['winner'] != played['team2'])).sum())\n","print(m.shape, d.shape)\n","\n","matches_clean, deliveries_clean = m, d\n","matches, deliveries = m, d   \n","\n","m.to_csv('matches_cleaned.csv', index=False)\n","d.to_csv('deliveries_cleaned.csv', index=False)\n","m.head()"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"873c2605","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.00613,"end_time":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.622429+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.616299+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["*The data was cleaned by fixing team, venue and city names that were spelled differently (for example Rising Pune Supergiant/Supergiants, M Chinnaswamy/M. Chinnaswamy Stadium and Bangalore/Bengaluru). Missing winners and player of the match were only in the 4 no result games, so they were filled as \"No Result\" and \"No Award\". Missing cities were all Dubai, filled from the venue. umpire3 was dropped since most of it was empty. Dates were in two different formats and were converted to one. Some super over balls were not flagged, and repeated deliveries were removed only when the over had more than 6 legal balls. The blanks in player_dismissed, dismissal_kind and fielder were left as they are, because they just mean no wicket fell on that ball. All checks (dates, runs, match IDs, winners) came back with 0 issues.*"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"3d85c648","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.006074,"end_time":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.634769+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.628695+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["**First Match of Each IPL Season**"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":3,"id":"e16cccda","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.648551Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.648239Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.669903Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.668994Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.030939,"end_time":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.671918+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-21T20:23:22.640979+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"